There you are.

00:23:42.970 --> 00:23:44.770
It looks like you walked around the entire palace today.

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:46.270
I've been running after you since morning.

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:48.100
What happened?

00:23:51.510 --> 00:23:54.110
There you are. Last night...

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:57.180
Let's discuss everything along the way.

00:23:57.810 --> 00:23:58.850
Let's go.

00:23:59.550 --> 00:24:00.680
Where shall we go?

00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:02.820
Shall we go somewhere again?

00:24:06.360 --> 00:24:07.790
The palace is too big.

00:24:33.350 --> 00:24:34.380
Gone?

00:24:37.420 --> 00:24:39.390
What did he want to ask?

00:24:41.690 --> 00:24:44.460
What do men ask in such situations?

00:24:46.130 --> 00:24:47.160
Well, was it good?

00:24:57.410 --> 00:24:58.710
Submit as usual.

00:25:00.740 --> 00:25:01.980
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:25:04.580 --> 00:25:05.880
Something is wrong here.

00:25:07.280 --> 00:25:08.320
Court lady Choi.

00:25:09.490 --> 00:25:10.590
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:25:10.850 --> 00:25:12.960
Why don't you tell me off anymore?

00:25:13.120 --> 00:25:15.960
It’s not appropriate to leave your chambers like this, Your Majesty.

00:25:16.660 --> 00:25:17.830
I need to be reminded of everything.

00:25:18.130 --> 00:25:20.430
I decided not to scold you anymore.

00:25:20.930 --> 00:25:22.200
What?

00:25:23.400 --> 00:25:24.530
Why is this happening all of a sudden?

00:25:25.530 --> 00:25:27.770
-Okay, go ahead.
-Fine.

00:25:31.540 --> 00:25:32.710
This is a surprise.

00:25:56.020 --> 00:25:57.120
From today

00:25:58.660 --> 00:26:01.490
I resign as regent.

00:26:44.800 --> 00:26:45.900
And therefore

00:26:47.010 --> 00:26:49.210
From now on I will rule alone.

00:26:49.540 --> 00:26:54.450
Long life to the king!

00:27:11.700 --> 00:27:14.000
At this rate I will soon die.

00:27:15.030 --> 00:27:18.400
All these experiences are finishing me off.

00:27:19.100 --> 00:27:21.470
Notify me that you are not hungry today?

00:27:21.910 --> 00:27:25.280
Do you want to hasten my demise?

00:27:25.540 --> 00:27:26.910
I'm sorry.

00:27:27.680 --> 00:27:28.880
However

00:27:29.180 --> 00:27:32.920
I still can't decide
order to bring food or not.

00:27:32.920 --> 00:27:36.020
If I order you to bring it, you will be angry,
that we remember you until your death.

00:27:36.760 --> 00:27:39.730
What are you saying, even such simple things

00:27:39.730 --> 00:27:41.930
Can’t you decide without me?!

00:27:43.030 --> 00:27:44.130
Dowager Queen!

00:27:46.430 --> 00:27:47.830
Please, moderate your anger.

00:27:51.800 --> 00:27:53.910
Is it possible not to be angry in such a situation?

00:27:54.140 --> 00:27:57.640
I practically lost my influence in the palace.

00:27:58.610 --> 00:28:00.750
I will help you regain your former power.

00:28:02.650 --> 00:28:04.980
You will become regent again.

00:28:06.120 --> 00:28:07.550
And you are very self-confident.

00:28:08.550 --> 00:28:10.620
Your father was the same when he was young.

00:28:11.960 --> 00:28:14.660
This is the last chance.

00:28:15.190 --> 00:28:17.060
And what needs to be done?

00:28:17.430 --> 00:28:20.370
Find a way to undermine the king's spirit.

00:28:22.530 --> 00:28:24.670
If everything goes well for him,

00:28:24.670 --> 00:28:27.170
think only about yourself and try not to give yourself away.

00:28:28.140 --> 00:28:29.240
Understood.

00:28:29.240 --> 00:28:32.840
However, it is unlikely that the old methods will be effective.

00:28:35.010 --> 00:28:37.150
The king should not be underestimated.

00:28:37.420 --> 00:28:41.520
Do you really think that the explosion was his doing?

00:28:42.220 --> 00:28:45.390
As a rule, the one who benefits most is to blame.

00:28:45.890 --> 00:28:48.660
I can’t believe I gave the throne to such a treacherous scoundrel.

00:28:54.830 --> 00:28:58.270
Your Majesty, congratulations on the end of your regency.

00:28:59.740 --> 00:29:00.940
Thank you.

00:29:03.110 --> 00:29:05.410
While you were away, a message was delivered

00:29:05.410 --> 00:29:07.180
from Daejojeon Pavilion.

00:29:08.110 --> 00:29:09.920
-From the queen?
-Yes, Your Majesty.

00:29:16.690 --> 00:29:19.590
I'm trying to put into words,
how I languish with longing for you,

00:29:19.890 --> 00:29:21.060
and I miss you even more.

00:29:24.430 --> 00:29:26.200
Something needs to be done about this.

00:29:33.040 --> 00:29:34.970
My desperate pleas were heard.

00:29:35.610 --> 00:29:36.710
How persistent.

00:29:37.710 --> 00:29:38.910
We need to meet.

00:29:43.120 --> 00:29:44.480
Are you here yet?

00:29:44.920 --> 00:29:47.050
To save me from this torment...

00:29:48.290 --> 00:29:49.390
Cheoljong?

00:29:49.820 --> 00:29:51.120
How did you know where I am?

00:29:51.290 --> 00:29:53.290
How is it like? You made the appointment yourself.

00:29:53.290 --> 00:29:55.960
-And my concubine called me here!
-Which concubine?

00:29:55.960 --> 00:29:57.630
When you don’t know, it’s even more interesting

00:29:57.630 --> 00:29:59.360
So I didn’t ask.

00:29:59.770 --> 00:30:01.300
In any case, I didn’t write to you.

00:30:01.700 --> 00:30:04.000
Sometimes thoughts of a different kind come to me.

00:30:05.540 --> 00:30:08.240
I wish I could drown in a stream of thoughts about you.

00:30:08.740 --> 00:30:11.840
Come close to me.

00:30:12.710 --> 00:30:17.520
Oh! I wouldn't let you go for anything!

00:30:17.680 --> 00:30:19.580
-Enough.
-Is it clear now?

00:30:20.150 --> 00:30:21.190
No.

00:30:21.290 --> 00:30:23.260
Not lyricism, but some kind of shame. First time I've heard it.

00:30:23.260 --> 00:30:25.420
Your name will be on my lips until I rest.

00:30:25.620 --> 00:30:27.890
It will occupy all my thoughts, I will never forget him.

00:30:27.990 --> 00:30:29.660
Enough. There are people here.

00:30:31.060 --> 00:30:33.500
So what? It wasn't you who wrote it.

00:30:40.370 --> 00:30:42.740
We need to discuss something. Leave us alone.

00:30:42.740 --> 00:30:43.880
Fine?

00:30:43.880 --> 00:30:45.910
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:30:53.920 --> 00:30:55.190
Are you secretly following me?

00:30:55.320 --> 00:30:56.960
Are you reading the correspondence?

00:30:57.620 --> 00:30:58.820
What are you talking about?

00:30:59.420 --> 00:31:01.830
In messages you confess your love.

00:31:01.830 --> 00:31:03.460
And when we see each other, you pretend to be indifferent.

00:31:04.400 --> 00:31:05.830
How can you be so cruel?

00:31:10.670 --> 00:31:12.070
Or was the letter delivered to the wrong place?!

00:31:12.800 --> 00:31:14.570
It turns out that the messages were not intended for me?

00:31:14.570 --> 00:31:16.680
It turns out that it was because of you that my heart skipped a beat?

00:31:17.480 --> 00:31:19.850
Are you my last chance to get my male power back?

00:31:20.050 --> 00:31:23.010
It's because of you that my heart breaks every night

00:31:24.050 --> 00:31:25.520
trembled?

00:31:25.950 --> 00:31:27.850
So this is the reason for your split.

00:31:29.220 --> 00:31:30.320
Why was it you?

00:31:30.560 --> 00:31:32.220
Why is it always you?

00:31:32.220 --> 00:31:34.430
Even in my dreams you appear to me!

00:31:35.160 --> 00:31:36.530
Did I appear to you in your dreams?

00:31:37.030 --> 00:31:40.600
Watch your language. One more stupidity and this can be considered a confession.

00:31:40.900 --> 00:31:42.730
There are different dreams, you know.

00:31:43.000 --> 00:31:44.740
Nightmares, for example.

00:31:45.870 --> 00:31:47.340
Why did you help me at the feast?

00:31:49.540 --> 00:31:51.710
Followed me to ask this?!

00:31:52.410 --> 00:31:54.780
I might as well thank you. In vain it only helped.

00:31:54.980 --> 00:31:56.780
She said it herself, swear - if you’re happy to see,

00:31:56.780 --> 00:31:59.150
and look for fights if grateful.

00:31:59.280 --> 00:32:01.520
Why did you suddenly decide to listen to me?

00:32:01.520 --> 00:32:03.420
I did it your way, but you’re still unhappy?

00:32:03.920 --> 00:32:06.060
What are you supposed to do then?

00:32:06.490 --> 00:32:08.730
We distance ourselves, then suddenly you help.

00:32:08.730 --> 00:32:11.200
Then suddenly you say
that she would easily betray me.

00:32:11.860 --> 00:32:13.230
Yes, then I just...

00:32:15.230 --> 00:32:16.270
Wait a minute.

00:32:18.340 --> 00:32:20.340
So did you hear everything?

00:32:22.470 --> 00:32:24.580
It turns out he lied about losing his hearing?

00:32:25.680 --> 00:32:26.810
Really...

00:32:28.010 --> 00:32:29.680
It turns out that the explosion was your doing?

00:32:30.620 --> 00:32:32.620
I actually lost my hearing for a while.

00:32:33.220 --> 00:32:35.950
But he returned just as you were saying those words.

00:32:36.860 --> 00:32:39.390
Lost your mind? You could have died!

00:32:39.550 --> 00:32:40.400
My queen!

00:32:40.500 --> 00:32:42.550
Why risk yourself?!

00:33:02.210 --> 00:33:04.580
What? This is a prohibited technique!

00:33:04.880 --> 00:33:07.520
You always hug, smile, sleep next to...

00:33:07.590 --> 00:33:09.250
All this is prohibited.

00:33:12.920 --> 00:33:14.730
I forbid you to forbid me.

00:33:25.340 --> 00:33:27.240
I love you.

00:33:32.310 --> 00:33:33.480
So amorous?

00:33:33.780 --> 00:33:36.210
All because of one night spent together?
You shouldn't do that.

00:33:36.210 --> 00:33:37.620
No, that's not why.

00:33:37.620 --> 00:33:39.250
Then why?

00:33:40.220 --> 00:33:43.720
You're arrogant, narcissistic, uncouth

00:33:43.890 --> 00:33:45.160
and fickle.

00:33:45.590 --> 00:33:47.090
You have many shortcomings.

00:33:47.730 --> 00:33:50.600
That's the point. So don't love me.

00:33:50.600 --> 00:33:52.530
But I still love it.

00:33:53.670 --> 00:33:56.570
And I will love, let you have

00:33:57.440 --> 00:33:58.970
all the shortcomings of the world.

00:34:09.850 --> 00:34:10.950
Remember what I said

00:34:13.290 --> 00:34:14.820
the night before

00:34:16.020 --> 00:34:17.390
how to jump into a pond?

00:34:19.290 --> 00:34:21.430
You must love me.

00:34:24.200 --> 00:34:26.460
I said this because it seemed to me then

00:34:26.460 --> 00:34:27.900
that only I can protect you.

00:34:29.030 --> 00:34:31.840
Because I thought there was no other way to help you.

00:34:32.200 --> 00:34:34.710
That this is the only way to save both you and me.

00:34:35.970 --> 00:34:37.440
So this is the reason?

00:34:37.440 --> 00:34:38.540
But you know what?

00:34:39.880 --> 00:34:42.680
That Kim So-yeon is no more.

00:34:44.050 --> 00:34:45.980
Ta Kim So-yeon died that night.

00:34:49.490 --> 00:34:52.020
I won't hurt you anymore.

00:34:54.530 --> 00:34:56.330
We have no future.

00:34:59.060 --> 00:35:00.570
Because I will never forgive you.

00:35:03.940 --> 00:35:05.900
I'm not Kim Soyeon.

00:35:06.300 --> 00:35:08.610
Therefore I have no right.

00:35:26.260 --> 00:35:29.460
What kind of people? Does Her Majesty need something?

00:35:30.500 --> 00:35:33.300
-Thank you for your help.
-Help?

00:35:34.530 --> 00:35:35.970
In the palace infirmary.

00:35:36.030 --> 00:35:38.640
Oh, that's it, I just...

00:35:38.640 --> 00:35:41.240
I gave you poisoned water.

00:35:42.470 --> 00:35:45.510
Let it be so, but they also ordered acupuncture with moxibustion.

00:35:46.240 --> 00:35:48.850
Therefore, I should thank you.

00:35:51.920 --> 00:35:53.050
I found it on the way.

00:35:55.090 --> 00:35:56.250
But...

00:36:02.830 --> 00:36:06.230
Where did she find such an expensive thing?

00:36:11.240 --> 00:36:12.940
An assassination attempt on the king?

00:36:13.340 --> 00:36:16.040
Why didn't you consult us before doing this?

00:36:16.040 --> 00:36:17.880
Look what this has led to.

00:36:17.880 --> 00:36:21.610
Kim Jwageun must have reached his limit.

00:36:31.760 --> 00:36:33.390
I understand that you wanted money,

00:36:33.390 --> 00:36:34.790
but sell our weapons?

00:36:35.090 --> 00:36:36.800
Are you trying to destroy this country?

00:36:36.800 --> 00:36:38.730
You have made it clear that there is no problem.

00:36:39.030 --> 00:36:41.970
You need people to achieve your goals.

00:36:41.970 --> 00:36:43.970
And for this we need money.

00:36:45.170 --> 00:36:47.540
Are you saying you did this for me?

00:36:47.540 --> 00:36:50.810
I wanted to show the results
without interfering with the process itself.

00:36:50.810 --> 00:36:52.240
I did everything for this!

00:36:52.680 --> 00:36:54.210
I tried for you

00:36:54.480 --> 00:36:58.180
and for the sake of our family.

00:37:00.850 --> 00:37:01.920
Get ready

00:37:01.920 --> 00:37:04.960
take responsibility if there is no other way.

00:37:10.800 --> 00:37:12.760
I'll give you a chance to atone.

00:37:21.540 --> 00:37:24.140
-Is everyone here?
-Mr.

00:37:25.310 --> 00:37:28.250
The queen's father is not yet there.

00:37:29.580 --> 00:37:31.120
He wasn't invited.

00:37:31.520 --> 00:37:34.990
We are gathered here because of his mistake.

00:37:35.390 --> 00:37:37.520
He kept records of property

00:37:38.590 --> 00:37:40.430
belonging to our family.

00:37:44.800 --> 00:37:49.000
Fortunately, I have this ledger.

00:37:50.540 --> 00:37:54.310
As long as my influence remains, she is useless

00:37:54.310 --> 00:37:55.640
and you don't need to worry.

00:37:57.680 --> 00:37:58.710
But

00:37:59.280 --> 00:38:02.480
as soon as I lose my influence,

00:38:05.020 --> 00:38:07.090
I can't protect the book.

00:38:10.360 --> 00:38:12.620
If you protect me

00:38:13.120 --> 00:38:15.230
I will protect you in return.

00:38:15.930 --> 00:38:18.230
If we decide to protect you,

00:38:18.660 --> 00:38:19.800
what

00:38:21.030 --> 00:38:23.000
will you do with the king?

00:38:23.970 --> 00:38:25.270
If we don't do anything,

00:38:25.270 --> 00:38:28.810
he will kick us out because we did not remove you from office.

00:38:29.870 --> 00:38:32.910
A council was formed to solve government problems.

00:38:35.250 --> 00:38:36.450
Border Security Council?

00:38:37.080 --> 00:38:39.450
The incompetent king takes power into his own hands -

00:38:39.450 --> 00:38:41.450
serious government problem.

00:38:42.520 --> 00:38:44.720
All policy decisions

00:38:45.990 --> 00:38:48.430
will be reviewed by the Border Security Council.

00:38:50.760 --> 00:38:52.260
I've prepared everything.

00:38:52.600 --> 00:38:55.600
Like you said, we froze the water with arsenic in it.

00:38:55.600 --> 00:38:58.170
When the ice melted, the arsenic came out.

00:38:58.170 --> 00:39:00.670
How much time does it take
so that arsenic dissolves?

00:39:01.270 --> 00:39:02.910
It depends on the weather

00:39:03.240 --> 00:39:05.380
but in tea it won't take much time.

00:39:06.780 --> 00:39:07.850
It's clear.

00:39:08.450 --> 00:39:12.080
By the way, may I know who your target is?

00:39:12.980 --> 00:39:15.620
If I get rid of one woman in the palace,

00:39:15.850 --> 00:39:18.920
the two men who threaten my position will be broken.

00:39:34.470 --> 00:39:36.170
Thank you for persevering.

00:39:37.510 --> 00:39:40.550
You have endured such excruciating torture.

00:39:41.910 --> 00:39:43.080
I won't forget this.

00:39:45.120 --> 00:39:48.890
Now that you have been exposed, it is dangerous to remain in the palace.

00:39:49.820 --> 00:39:51.290
Leave the palace.

00:39:52.490 --> 00:39:54.790
It's time for you to live your life.

00:40:44.980 --> 00:40:46.440
I'll do anything

00:40:51.080 --> 00:40:52.580
to make your dreams come true.

00:41:14.910 --> 00:41:16.240
It felt somehow empty.

00:41:18.010 --> 00:41:20.550
How many of you still want...

00:41:22.680 --> 00:41:23.750
You are here.

00:41:47.110 --> 00:41:48.540
I have to put

00:41:49.670 --> 00:41:53.240
a hexagonal ice cube in the queen's bowl?

00:41:54.650 --> 00:41:55.680
Yes.

00:42:00.080 --> 00:42:02.350
Just add an ice cube. This is all.

00:42:15.500 --> 00:42:16.530
Your Majesty.

00:42:17.440 --> 00:42:21.310
I have very important information.

00:42:21.940 --> 00:42:24.440
Please help me.

00:42:25.310 --> 00:42:27.350
What do you have there?

00:42:27.710 --> 00:42:30.620
If you promise to spare me...

00:42:31.180 --> 00:42:32.850
How dare you?

00:42:33.250 --> 00:42:34.320
Court lady Han.

00:42:37.460 --> 00:42:41.530
I know you are a brave girl, but now you are trembling with fear.

00:42:42.630 --> 00:42:44.530
I don't know what you have there

00:42:45.230 --> 00:42:47.600
but I will help you in any way I can.

00:42:50.000 --> 00:42:52.840
Kim Jwageun asked me...

00:42:56.710 --> 00:42:58.910
Why didn't he like her from the very beginning?

00:42:59.440 --> 00:43:01.310
Then Kim So-yeon wouldn't have tried to die.

00:43:01.310 --> 00:43:02.880
And I wouldn't be here.

00:43:04.880 --> 00:43:06.250
But what's more important is

00:43:11.590 --> 00:43:14.160
I thought I had experienced everything possible.

00:43:16.090 --> 00:43:18.600
But apparently there was something I hadn't encountered.

00:43:19.460 --> 00:43:21.470
How to explain that feeling last night?

00:43:23.770 --> 00:43:26.940
If everything before was like a soft piece of bread,

00:43:26.940 --> 00:43:28.170
then it was...

00:43:31.210 --> 00:43:35.050
No, this was new.
I was interested in something new.

00:43:35.580 --> 00:43:37.080
Come to your senses, Chan Soyeon.

00:43:38.020 --> 00:43:41.020
Damn it. I even confuse the names.

00:43:42.290 --> 00:43:43.390
Queen.

00:43:44.520 --> 00:43:45.990
Yes. Come in.

00:43:51.400 --> 00:43:55.130
The Queen Dowager asked you to have breakfast together.

00:43:56.230 --> 00:43:58.670
Breakfast at this time?

00:44:00.610 --> 00:44:04.140
I'm not in the mood to cook right now.

00:44:07.380 --> 00:44:11.820
The Queen Dowager has already prepared everything.

00:44:13.420 --> 00:44:14.820
Am I going to Dongmyeongjeong Hall?

00:44:15.190 --> 00:44:17.090
I've been running all day today and I'm hungry.

00:44:18.860 --> 00:44:20.660
They want to get rid of the queen?

00:44:21.490 --> 00:44:23.760
The accounting book is now with Kim Jwageun.

00:44:24.400 --> 00:44:25.900
Who knew she was in the Daejojeon Hall?

00:44:26.360 --> 00:44:27.530
How...

00:44:28.630 --> 00:44:30.070
I'll go back to the palace.

00:44:36.010 --> 00:44:37.070
Here.

00:44:52.190 --> 00:44:53.960
Why are you stuck? Hurry up!

00:44:53.960 --> 00:44:55.130
I'm coming.

00:45:06.770 --> 00:45:08.970
You're leaving me again.

00:45:10.440 --> 00:45:14.250
You know, Imp, I'm starting to get angry with you.

00:45:29.230 --> 00:45:31.130
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:45:32.000 --> 00:45:34.730
Breakfast, and with such a beautiful view.

00:45:35.000 --> 00:45:38.200
I'm no longer regent, so I have a lot of free time.

00:45:38.540 --> 00:45:40.840
We should have breakfast together more often.

00:45:41.470 --> 00:45:43.540
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:45:51.820 --> 00:45:54.490
Breakfast cannot be complete without drinks.

00:45:59.160 --> 00:46:03.060
The one who will die in the palace today is the queen.

00:46:06.300 --> 00:46:07.770
My son

00:46:08.730 --> 00:46:11.140
I can finally take revenge.

00:47:16.530 --> 00:47:18.540
I specially prepared the ice

00:47:18.540 --> 00:47:21.610
which is more expensive than gold today.

00:47:26.480 --> 00:47:28.080
This will be my first time seeing ice here.

00:47:28.680 --> 00:47:31.150
It's so hot today

00:47:31.180 --> 00:47:34.320
perfect time for a cool drink.

00:47:44.860 --> 00:47:47.630
My queen. Please.

00:47:47.770 --> 00:47:49.100
I beg you. My queen.

00:48:11.300 --> 00:48:12.430
How dare you...

00:48:12.530 --> 00:48:17.440
I have something to tell the queen.

00:48:17.540 --> 00:48:19.100
How dare you come here? Leave.

00:48:19.100 --> 00:48:21.010
This is very important.

00:48:22.670 --> 00:48:23.770
Damhyang?

00:48:24.040 --> 00:48:25.840
Well why are you doing this?

00:48:25.840 --> 00:48:27.980
I'll get in trouble because of you.

00:48:28.910 --> 00:48:31.050
What's so important?

00:48:36.820 --> 00:48:38.620
Do you know this court lady?

00:48:40.290 --> 00:48:43.090
Yes. I often see her in the royal kitchen.

00:48:44.860 --> 00:48:47.060
Damhyang, what happened?

00:48:47.670 --> 00:48:49.100
The thing is...

00:48:53.270 --> 00:48:54.940
You see...

00:49:01.750 --> 00:49:02.810
I'm sorry.

00:49:19.600 --> 00:49:22.770
I came to attend the meal
the dowager queen.

00:49:23.730 --> 00:49:26.340
These are women's get-togethers. You didn't have to come.

00:49:27.400 --> 00:49:30.510
This is the first time I have seen the Queen at such a meeting.

00:49:31.080 --> 00:49:32.340
My apologies.

00:49:33.780 --> 00:49:35.980
It's an honor for me.

00:49:36.310 --> 00:49:39.420
How are things going with keeping an eye on your husband?

00:49:46.020 --> 00:49:48.230
Now that the king has woken up,

00:49:48.330 --> 00:49:50.430
I will do my best.

00:49:52.930 --> 00:49:55.570
You need to drink before the precious ice melts.

00:50:06.880 --> 00:50:08.150
How do you like it?

00:50:09.350 --> 00:50:10.920
The taste is so refreshing.

00:50:14.850 --> 00:50:16.420
I liked it so much that I couldn’t resist.

00:50:58.230 --> 00:50:59.330
My queen!

00:51:10.470 --> 00:51:11.540
Your Majesty!

00:51:16.910 --> 00:51:18.120
How dare you?

00:51:18.380 --> 00:51:20.450
What have you done here?

00:51:23.350 --> 00:51:25.990
-Are you okay?
-What? Yes.

00:51:26.120 --> 00:51:28.630
How dare you throw a stone at the queen?

00:51:30.330 --> 00:51:32.060
I'm fine, Your Majesty.

00:51:38.140 --> 00:51:40.170
Take this girl into custody.

00:51:40.840 --> 00:51:42.870
She will be punished for what she did.

00:51:45.240 --> 00:51:46.280
Your Majesty.

00:51:48.780 --> 00:51:49.880
Come with me.

00:51:51.320 --> 00:51:52.420
Damhyang.

00:52:01.930 --> 00:52:03.490
She is very important to me.

00:52:03.530 --> 00:52:06.760
I'm fine, so don't be mad.

00:52:06.760 --> 00:52:08.730
This has nothing to do with you.

00:52:09.200 --> 00:52:11.540
She made a mess in the palace

00:52:11.540 --> 00:52:13.670
and violated the established order.

00:52:14.740 --> 00:52:16.370
She's just a child.

00:52:16.810 --> 00:52:18.410
I'm sure she had a reason.

00:52:18.410 --> 00:52:20.040
She wouldn't do this without a reason.

00:52:20.040 --> 00:52:21.650
If you continue like this,

00:52:21.650 --> 00:52:23.710
I'll accuse her of inappropriate behavior

00:52:23.710 --> 00:52:25.620
and I will punish you even more severely.

00:52:30.350 --> 00:52:32.420
Why did you come in such a hurry?

00:52:33.190 --> 00:52:37.190
Did you know that the child would try to harm the queen?

00:52:39.100 --> 00:52:40.960
Are you trying to drag me into this too?

00:52:41.070 --> 00:52:44.740
It's just that the timing of your arrival coincided perfectly.

00:52:44.770 --> 00:52:46.400
I was worried

00:52:46.400 --> 00:52:48.910
that the person who planned treason

00:52:48.910 --> 00:52:50.540
is next to the queen.

00:52:51.080 --> 00:52:52.740
This meeting is ruined.

00:52:53.240 --> 00:52:54.710
I will return to Dongmyeongjeong.

00:53:06.960 --> 00:53:09.860
I will definitely punish the child for violating our plans.

00:53:10.460 --> 00:53:12.500
You too will take responsibility,

00:53:12.930 --> 00:53:14.800
so as not to endanger our species.

00:53:22.270 --> 00:53:23.440
What will happen to her now?

00:53:23.540 --> 00:53:26.210
They won't flog the girl, will they?

00:53:26.410 --> 00:53:28.080
Are you sure you're okay?

00:53:28.080 --> 00:53:30.880
Maybe your tongue goes numb or your heart beats like crazy?

00:53:32.050 --> 00:53:33.680
What are you even talking about?
Really...

00:53:33.680 --> 00:53:35.090
Not here.

00:53:36.190 --> 00:53:38.060
The queen and I are going to Daejojeon.

00:53:38.660 --> 00:53:39.960
Yes, sir.

00:53:55.340 --> 00:53:57.340
I beg you, from now on

00:53:57.910 --> 00:54:00.510
watch everything you eat or drink.

00:54:01.350 --> 00:54:03.250
Did I annoy someone?

00:54:06.180 --> 00:54:09.990
I'm sure Kim Jwageun and the Queen Dowager tried to poison you.

00:54:11.320 --> 00:54:14.360
Some kind of nonsense. I didn't do anything!

00:54:16.860 --> 00:54:20.400
Or is it all because I helped with the feast?

00:54:21.270 --> 00:54:22.670
Found in your chambers

00:54:24.230 --> 00:54:25.940
accounting book.

00:54:26.970 --> 00:54:28.010
Account book?

00:54:30.610 --> 00:54:33.340
So Kim Jwageun and my father asked me about her.

00:54:34.240 --> 00:54:36.250
What's wrong with this book?

00:54:37.280 --> 00:54:39.420
Didn't you bring it with you from home?

00:54:40.020 --> 00:54:41.620
Yes, I had no idea it existed.

00:54:41.620 --> 00:54:44.020
I haven’t seen her at home, much less here.

00:54:45.820 --> 00:54:47.020
Here's how.

00:54:47.830 --> 00:54:49.790
They wanted to poison, not overthrow.

00:54:51.730 --> 00:54:53.660
So Damhyang saved me?

00:54:54.130 --> 00:54:55.200
It turns out so.

00:54:55.430 --> 00:54:56.900
Poison in the drink.

00:54:58.070 --> 00:55:00.100
I took a couple of sips.

00:55:00.440 --> 00:55:03.240
I will find out everything from Damhyang.

00:55:03.570 --> 00:55:05.010
I'll ask her myself.

00:55:05.340 --> 00:55:07.850
Will she be okay?
She shouldn't get hurt.

00:55:08.210 --> 00:55:10.350
The one who planned to poison you

00:55:10.350 --> 00:55:11.880
won't let her go just like that.

00:55:14.450 --> 00:55:16.490
Save her, I beg you.

00:55:22.160 --> 00:55:23.790
I'll do my best.

00:56:17.180 --> 00:56:20.150
I haven't committed any crimes.

00:56:20.780 --> 00:56:22.220
I didn't steal this money.

00:56:23.050 --> 00:56:25.490
I've been saving them for many years,

00:56:25.490 --> 00:56:27.320
to redeem the youngest from slavery.

00:56:32.200 --> 00:56:33.300
Please have mercy.

00:56:34.460 --> 00:56:36.930
If I die, my youngest...

00:56:42.640 --> 00:56:44.110
Say everything you know

00:56:45.910 --> 00:56:47.110
about this noriga.

00:57:02.730 --> 00:57:04.900
-Damhyang!
-Your Majesty!

00:57:06.030 --> 00:57:08.100
Are you okay, queen?

00:57:08.100 --> 00:57:09.900
This is what you need to ask.

00:57:10.300 --> 00:57:12.040
What a blessing that you tried it

00:57:12.470 --> 00:57:16.240
drink before the ice melts.

00:57:17.980 --> 00:57:18.980
Ice?

00:57:20.410 --> 00:57:21.710
Translate it now!

00:57:21.710 --> 00:57:22.710
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:57:25.520 --> 00:57:27.990
Where are you transferring her to? Where?

00:57:32.260 --> 00:57:34.560
Your Majesty, you shouldn't be here.

00:57:34.990 --> 00:57:37.190
You know that she is not to blame for anything.

00:57:37.190 --> 00:57:38.600
I don't understand you.

00:57:40.930 --> 00:57:43.500
She's only guilty of saving me.

00:57:44.330 --> 00:57:46.600
I don't know who told you that
but please

00:57:46.940 --> 00:57:48.210
come back to yourself.

00:57:51.010 --> 00:57:52.110
What if I refuse?

00:57:53.140 --> 00:57:55.980
The girl will be tried in accordance with the laws.

00:57:56.980 --> 00:57:59.220
If you stay, you will suffer.

00:58:00.450 --> 00:58:02.290
Escort the queen to her chambers.

00:58:02.290 --> 00:58:03.320
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:58:07.560 --> 00:58:09.790
-Let me in!
-I will accompany the queen.

00:58:18.170 --> 00:58:20.000
Go back to your place, queen.

00:58:20.640 --> 00:58:24.640
Loud scandals
You won't help this girl in any way.

00:58:26.410 --> 00:58:27.440
Your Majesty!

00:58:45.260 --> 00:58:48.430
Damhyang, I will free you soon.
Agreed?

00:58:49.930 --> 00:58:51.770
Don't be afraid of anything.

00:58:52.400 --> 00:58:53.870
Fine.

00:58:55.940 --> 00:58:58.480
Queen, it's time for us to go.

00:59:00.780 --> 00:59:01.910
I will set you free.

00:59:27.500 --> 00:59:31.370
How dare the court lady
throw a stone at the queen?

00:59:31.370 --> 00:59:32.980
This is an insult to the royal person!

00:59:32.980 --> 00:59:36.350
Everything is much worse!
This is already treason!

00:59:37.180 --> 00:59:39.150
Heard her father is accused of deviance

00:59:39.150 --> 00:59:41.150
from military service and treason.

00:59:41.150 --> 00:59:42.850
They say exactly that blood is not water.

00:59:44.250 --> 00:59:46.620
Dear Ministers, you are overreacting.

00:59:46.620 --> 00:59:49.860
We don't know yet
what prompted her to do this.

00:59:50.160 --> 00:59:53.000
Peasant revolt
is gaining momentum and

00:59:53.000 --> 00:59:55.270
threatens royal power.

00:59:55.430 --> 00:59:57.130
Using this girl as an example, we must

00:59:57.130 --> 00:59:58.970
strengthen your power among the people.

00:59:58.970 --> 01:00:00.970
Now you are dragging in the rebel peasants?

01:00:00.970 --> 01:00:04.440
How dare she throw a stone at the queen?

01:00:04.440 --> 01:00:07.340
I'm sure those thugs brainwashed her!

01:00:07.580 --> 01:00:11.250
Brainwashed by bandits?
The girl is only five years old.

01:00:11.250 --> 01:00:13.020
Don't take it as insolence

01:00:13.250 --> 01:00:15.820
but some believe
what are you, sir?

01:00:16.150 --> 01:00:19.320
living in Ganghwado,
communicated with the rebel bandits.

01:00:20.020 --> 01:00:23.030
Now you decide to threaten me with this?

01:00:23.860 --> 01:00:26.700
If you refuse to punish the girl
and try to save her,

01:00:27.030 --> 01:00:31.540
you will only confirm our suspicions that

01:00:32.240 --> 01:00:34.170
that you agree with the bandits.

01:00:35.410 --> 01:00:38.340
All you need to do is punish the maid for disobedience.

01:00:38.980 --> 01:00:40.680
And it will all be over.

01:00:46.980 --> 01:00:48.650
He'll listen to us, right?

01:00:49.250 --> 01:00:52.460
Dowager Queen
asked us to insist on punishment.

01:00:53.090 --> 01:00:55.430
Takes out her anger on him for

01:00:55.430 --> 01:00:57.060
that she was removed from the throne?

01:00:57.490 --> 01:00:59.800
Like this worthless girl

01:00:59.800 --> 01:01:04.170
dare to interfere with us
get rid of the queen?

01:01:25.590 --> 01:01:27.460
Why did it take so long?

01:01:28.590 --> 01:01:29.990
Everything will be fine, won't it?

01:01:30.690 --> 01:01:33.500
Such late meetings
never leads to good things.

01:01:36.170 --> 01:01:37.800
-Your Majesty.
-Yes?

01:02:00.660 --> 01:02:02.560
This way, Your Majesty!

01:02:02.560 --> 01:02:03.660
Fine.

01:02:09.400 --> 01:02:12.840
Remember this moment for the rest of your life.

01:02:13.170 --> 01:02:18.010
Courtiers in the palace
must be blind and deaf to what is happening,

01:02:18.980 --> 01:02:22.850
There should not be a single rebellious thought in their minds.

01:02:23.480 --> 01:02:26.150
If at least one of you supports

01:02:26.150 --> 01:02:29.750
a peasant uprising is what awaits you.

01:02:31.290 --> 01:02:33.260
The maid was an unreasonable child.

01:02:35.060 --> 01:02:36.130
Quiet!

01:02:39.330 --> 01:02:41.300
I thought we caught someone important

01:02:42.800 --> 01:02:45.770
but is it just a child?
It's mind boggling!

01:02:54.740 --> 01:02:55.780
Are we late?

01:03:04.550 --> 01:03:06.390
Now you know how I feel.

01:03:14.560 --> 01:03:16.770
She wanted to save you.

01:03:17.970 --> 01:03:19.200
That's why they killed her.

01:03:21.070 --> 01:03:22.870
They wanted to poison me, but Damhyang stopped me.

01:04:06.480 --> 01:04:07.880
She is not to blame for anything.

01:04:08.890 --> 01:04:10.150
You said it yourself

01:04:11.490 --> 01:04:15.590
they laid their sins on a little child!

01:04:21.560 --> 01:04:22.800
Why didn't you save her?

01:04:24.030 --> 01:04:26.000
She became a sacrifice for something greater.

01:04:27.800 --> 01:04:28.840
More?

01:04:30.710 --> 01:04:31.980
Are you talking about your skin?

01:04:34.780 --> 01:04:38.010
Wasn't it you who told me
that the world is unfair?

01:04:38.850 --> 01:04:42.650
An insignificant sacrifice will stop
something much more dangerous!

01:04:44.090 --> 01:04:45.260
An insignificant sacrifice?

01:04:48.320 --> 01:04:49.430
Because

01:04:50.490 --> 01:04:52.300
Is she just a defenseless girl?

01:04:56.000 --> 01:04:57.430
Amateurism is a sin.

01:04:58.970 --> 01:05:01.200
You couldn't save this girl!

01:05:03.970 --> 01:05:05.110
You are a sinner.

01:05:30.600 --> 01:05:32.400
If you don't want to talk,
do we use hand signals?

01:05:32.400 --> 01:05:33.500
For example, this one.

01:05:33.500 --> 01:05:35.710
This means that I'm lying about everything.

01:05:36.040 --> 01:05:37.170
What do you say?

01:06:06.370 --> 01:06:08.810
From this day on I will become
the most reckless one in the palace.

01:06:08.810 --> 01:06:12.680
I'll show you what happens when you piss me off.

01:06:12.680 --> 01:06:14.740
Have you tried to get rid of the queen?

01:06:14.910 --> 01:06:16.650
-Damhyang!
-Damhyang!

01:06:18.010 --> 01:06:19.250
I bet everything!

01:06:19.250 --> 01:06:20.650
Don't underestimate Kim Byungin.

01:06:20.650 --> 01:06:22.450
Even the Cho clan obeys him.

01:06:22.450 --> 01:06:23.620
Let's become allies.

01:06:23.620 --> 01:06:26.490
From now on, forget about distancing.

01:06:26.490 --> 01:06:28.020
Calm down, wild heart.

01:06:28.020 --> 01:06:30.190
This is all just a test.

01:06:30.190 --> 01:06:32.430
Do you want us to eat some ramen?
